Task: cdos-desktop
Section: user
Relevance: 8
Description: CDOS desktop environment
 A KDE Plasma desktop with the essential applications for CDOS:
 terminal, file manager, network manager, screenshot tool,
 archive tools, text editor, and Firefox ESR.
