Task: cdos-developer
Section: user
Relevance: 7
Description: CDOS developer tools
 The CDOS desktop plus a full developer toolchain: Java (21, 25),
 Python 3, Node.js, Go, build tools, Git, Neovim, and a
 comprehensive set of CLI and diagnostic utilities.
