Task: cdos-full
Section: user
Relevance: 6
Description: CDOS full environment
 The developer environment plus office applications:
 Thunderbird, KMail, and FileZilla. Note: VSCode, Docker,
 and ONLYOFFICE are not included here because they require
 external APT repositories that are not configured during
 the installation. See the project README for how to add them.
